# BOOTSTRAP-ALLOWLIST
#
# This file is the visible bootstrap boundary of the Herbert stack.
# Every git-tracked file whose name does not end in `.herb` must appear
# below, by exact repository-relative path. `.herb` files are never listed.
#
# No Python, shell or other host-language program is left in the tree;
# what remains is build and CI configuration, the seed, documents and data.
#
# Adding a line here is a deliberate, reviewable act, never incidental.
# `make check` enforces that this file and the tracked file set match
# exactly, in both directions.

